<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
    <title>403 · 无法访问</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC",
          "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
        color: #202b29;
        background: #f5f7f5;
        color-scheme: light;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        min-height: 100svh;
        margin: 0;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 32px 24px;
      }
      main { width: 100%; max-width: 440px; }
      .code {
        margin: 0 0 24px;
        color: #53766a;
        font-size: clamp(80px, 20vw, 112px);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -6px;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }
      .description { margin: 0; color: #626e68; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.9; }
      footer {
        margin-top: 40px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dce3de;
        color: #626e68;
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root { color: #edf2ee; background: #151c19; color-scheme: dark; }
        .code { color: #9cbfae; }
        .description, footer { color: #a6b3aa; }
        footer { border-color: #354139; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main aria-labelledby="title">
      <p class="code" aria-hidden="true">403</p>
      <h1 id="title">暂时无法访问此页面</h1>
      <p class="description">
        你的请求未被允许。<br />
        如果你认为这是误拦截，请联系网站管理员。
      </p>
      <footer>403 FORBIDDEN · 访问受限</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
